 sidebar-switcher-megalist element exists before hiding it.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\n- Add a new marionette test to verify with different pref values at startup\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314156\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315732\n", "files": ["browser/components/sidebar/browser-sidebar.js", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/marionette/manifest.toml", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/marionette/test_contextual_password_manager_disabled.py"], "git_node": "f7ef8e87e9fe2eb98a1d2c7fe368f27047d2f2db", "git_parents": ["f6b2e4e36e4d1a320bc26c6e21a99474dde38f23"], "node": "f3a6d2f6ac500ba6341a3d916b685ff7f59f4736", "parents": ["aa218b7b2a422b05d6b86e3f6e1ac588871b75cd"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785703482, "git_changesets": ["f7ef8e87e9fe2eb98a1d2c7fe368f27047d2f2db"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "127": {"changesets": [{"author": "Harveer Singh \u003chsingh@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2025732: Increase Cache API opaque response padding.  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313509\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315608\n", "files": ["dom/cache/FileUtils.cpp", "dom/fetch/InternalResponse.cpp"], "git_node": "8b60dcaa25cb263765805847f495da08aba75828", "git_parents": ["f7ef8e87e9fe2eb98a1d2c7fe368f27047d2f2db"], "node": "3a98ea590464bf047ab2226b52cb1f30ebaaefb1", "parents": ["f3a6d2f6ac500ba6341a3d916b685ff7f59f4736"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785703507, "git_changesets": ["8b60dcaa25cb263765805847f495da08aba75828"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "128": {"changesets": [{"author": "Masayuki Nakano \u003cmasayuki@d-toybox.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2054161 - Make `FontFaceSet` create `Promise` only when `GetReady` is called  a=RyanVM DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314584\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315485\n", "files": ["layout/style/FontFaceSet.cpp"], "git_node": "a764ac26c1d8d598a77bbf505b9ec63ac3de8c6d", "git_parents": ["8b60dcaa25cb263765805847f495da08aba75828"], "node": "d76f3fa579212fec2d593006475f70e459538d2a", "parents": ["3a98ea590464bf047ab2226b52cb1f30ebaaefb1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785703531, "git_changesets": ["a764ac26c1d8d598a77bbf505b9ec63ac3de8c6d"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "129": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1952164 - Check for register uses in LIRGenerator::visitInt32ToIntPtr.  a=RyanVM\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314393\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315634\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/CodeGenerator.cpp", "js/src/jit/Lowering.cpp", "js/src/jit/MIR.h"], "git_node": "591f435b2856e3151a3bd7efaaf81884b5970851", "git_parents": ["a764ac26c1d8d598a77bbf505b9ec63ac3de8c6d"], "node": "25a2a341c70cb5262a91381d78df2d99a069e383", "parents": ["d76f3fa579212fec2d593006475f70e459538d2a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785703555, "git_changesets": ["591f435b2856e3151a3bd7efaaf81884b5970851"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "13": {"changesets": [{"author": "Tomislav Jovanovic \u003ctomica@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049148 - Verify both Port actors in the parent  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311434\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313081\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/extensions/ConduitsParent.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/extensions/ExtensionParent.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/extensions/test/xpcshell/test_ext_runtime_ports_membership.js", "toolkit/components/extensions/test/xpcshell/xpcshell-common.toml"], "git_node": "87bf6ab7fd88414655abac816345b5dbe7e36091", "git_parents": ["d4ba5199ab62348747e9510945adc381a0f9fbb3"], "node": "25ab22e0769001c50e788c7960d863770251d824", "parents": ["c810e58a8a4e91ae13a13f6ac2fcb612e255a76c"], "tags": []}], "date": 1784652271, "git_changesets": ["87bf6ab7fd88414655abac816345b5dbe7e36091"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "130": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nika Layzell \u003cnika@thelayzells.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056444 - Fetch same-process blob URL data directly instead of over IPC. a=pascalc\n\nA Blob backed by in-process memory (e.g. built from an ArrayBuffer) exposes a\nseekable input stream locally. Routing its data through the parent turned it\ninto a forward-only pipe, so a media element seeking near the end of the blob\nhad to read and discard everything before the target offset, hanging.\n\nFetch the blob data from this process's own BlobURLProtocolHandler store when\nthe entry is present (which it is for blobs owned by this process), keeping the\nstream seekable. Blobs owned by another process are still fetched over IPC.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314001\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314697\n", "files": ["dom/file/uri/BlobURLInputStream.cpp"], "git_node": "1c8df92ecd374d1482bc5cb05e582987837596b6", "git_parents": ["591f435b2856e3151a3bd7efaaf81884b5970851"], "node": "b56b5634606af13db02f49e31073c2979baddac5", "parents": ["25a2a341c70cb5262a91381d78df2d99a069e383"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Paul Adenot \u003cpaul@paul.cx\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056444 - Add a regression test for playing a video from a Blob rebuilt from an ArrayBuffer. a=pascalc\n\nBased on https://github.com/Vincent0700/firefox-arraybuffer-blob-video-repro :\na Blob constructed from an ArrayBuffer (rather than obtained directly via\nResponse.blob()) went through the same RemoteLazyInputStream-backed,\nasync-over-IPC path as any other Blob, so it hit the same playback bug as\nthe Blob URL case already covered by test_temporary_file_blob_video_plays.html.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313277\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314698\n", "files": ["dom/media/test/mochitest.toml", "dom/media/test/test_blob_from_arraybuffer_video_plays.html"], "git_node": "fb8220661b9c74b3c38d9ff7d41230192da402d2", "git_parents": ["1c8df92ecd374d1482bc5cb05e582987837596b6"], "node": "3780027ed358a2083ca3cc5ee5f3c01cd8de27c6", "parents": ["b56b5634606af13db02f49e31073c2979baddac5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Paul Adenot \u003cpaul@paul.cx\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056444 - Add a regression test for decoding and seeking a Blob read from CacheStorage. a=pascalc\n\nBased on a testcase in the bug: a Blob handed out by CacheStorage is not\nbacked by memory this process owns, so it is read asynchronously over\nIPC. Reading it back as an ArrayBuffer and decoding it with\ndecodeAudioData used to hang, and so did seeking close to the end of the\nre-encoded WAV shortly after canplaythrough, with two elements sharing\nthe data.\n\nThe WAV is padded with a 1kHz tone, like in the reporter's application, so that it\nexceeds the 1MB IPC inline serialization limit and the far seek is meaningful.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314416\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314699\n", "files": ["dom/media/test/mochitest.toml", "dom/media/test/test_blob_from_cachestorage_audio_seeks.html"], "git_node": "9711827bfd828d639ca8cc81bea72aeb48c2c58d", "git_parents": ["fb8220661b9c74b3c38d9ff7d41230192da402d2"], "node": "2da562e9933c076d089b52486cd60e12eb003092", "parents": ["3780027ed358a2083ca3cc5ee5f3c01cd8de27c6"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785703985, "git_changesets": ["1c8df92ecd374d1482bc5cb05e582987837596b6", "fb8220661b9c74b3c38d9ff7d41230192da402d2", "9711827bfd828d639ca8cc81bea72aeb48c2c58d"], "user": "rvandermeulen@mozilla.com"}, "131": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan-Niklas Jaeschke \u003cjjaschke@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2058666 - Clear mDocumentChildren after XSLT branch consumes it in DidBuildModel.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314950\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315329\n", "files": ["dom/xml/nsXMLContentSink.cpp"], "git_node": "6a35989702542dbc6dac02a2d194411181ed55b6", "git_parents": ["9711827bfd828d639ca8cc81bea72aeb48c2c58d"], "node": "3fdb7fa5c61fd5eddd6b3c19b4802f8d603580b8", "parents": ["2da562e9933c076d089b52486cd60e12eb003092"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785705612, "git_changesets": ["6a35989702542dbc6dac02a2d194411181ed55b6"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "132": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan-Niklas Jaeschke \u003cjjaschke@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2059121 - Hold strong reference to Document in HidePopoverInternal.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315331\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315334\n", "files": ["dom/html/nsGenericHTMLElement.cpp"], "git_node": "ab94b495f1037eae90f835792aada797ba6d5548", "git_parents": ["6a35989702542dbc6dac02a2d194411181ed55b6"], "node": "d7651bcc3c796bb660741c000197daf376ada673", "parents": ["3fdb7fa5c61fd5eddd6b3c19b4802f8d603580b8"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785705635, "git_changesets": ["ab94b495f1037eae90f835792aada797ba6d5548"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "133": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nika Layzell \u003cnika@thelayzells.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2054674 - ValidatePrincipal in PServiceWorker,  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313527\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315707\n", "files": ["dom/serviceworkers/ServiceWorker.cpp", "ipc/glue/BackgroundParentImpl.cpp"], "git_node": "38602fca85e9b77f077fad9143244c604e24ed07", "git_parents": ["ab94b495f1037eae90f835792aada797ba6d5548"], "node": "286bf7bdaf090b8d8e8e2bd659d384b0534a0e