 https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315490\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/WebGLFramebuffer.cpp", "dom/canvas/test/webgl-conf/generated/generated-mochitest-webgl2-core-conformance2.toml", "dom/canvas/test/webgl-conf/mochitest-errata.toml"], "git_node": "db021bd8511b1c48c8d63d912731935ec9f615a9", "git_parents": ["d5f12dca2b22d906c7100a6900de2d2f5ffcb86f"], "node": "a0cb7ff181d4b44ec50b1da34510c56730325c67", "parents": ["a0ff26c0fa07ad2812640a6a450e610d99ca42d0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785705833, "git_changesets": ["db021bd8511b1c48c8d63d912731935ec9f615a9"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "139": {"changesets": [{"author": "Dianna Smith \u003cdsmith@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2054674 - ValidatePrincipal in PServiceWorker,  a=diannaS \" for causing bustage a=backout\n\nThis reverts commit 38602fca85e9b77f077fad9143244c604e24ed07.\n", "files": ["dom/serviceworkers/ServiceWorker.cpp", "ipc/glue/BackgroundParentImpl.cpp"], "git_node": "aa24356bbecee5da0982046dae7a583b44403b84", "git_parents": ["db021bd8511b1c48c8d63d912731935ec9f615a9"], "node": "b05fc11db238b1282d83c3e989dfc33ae1a7aea5", "parents": ["a0cb7ff181d4b44ec50b1da34510c56730325c67"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785707645, "git_changesets": ["aa24356bbecee5da0982046dae7a583b44403b84"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "14": {"changesets": [{"author": "Manuel Bucher \u003cmanuel@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050425 - Handle missing actors in CookieStoreParent  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311875\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312719\n", "files": ["dom/cookiestore/CookieStoreParent.cpp"], "git_node": "ba86ed50c0713163eecbd16ceee717ae160330cd", "git_parents": ["87bf6ab7fd88414655abac816345b5dbe7e36091"], "node": "33599664359a6b9c3f3340dca04a1f763835ce27", "parents": ["25ab22e0769001c50e788c7960d863770251d824"], "tags": []}], "date": 1784652294, "git_changesets": ["ba86ed50c0713163eecbd16ceee717ae160330cd"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "140": {"changesets": [{"author": "Stephen A Pohl \u003cspohl@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2015460: Don't keep the requesting browser window alive during a macOS passkey handshake.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nMacOSAuthenticatorPresentationContextProvider held a strong reference to the requesting NSWindow for the lifetime of a passkey handshake. If the handshake stalled (the platform does not always invoke the completion callback) and the user then closed that window, the window had been -close'd but stayed retained, so it lingered as an invisible window that remains in Mission Control and captures mouse events over its old frame until Firefox is force-quit.\n\nStore the window number instead and resolve the presentation anchor lazily via -[NSApplication windowWithWindowNumber:], which returns nil once the window has closed. This removes the retain without depending on zeroing weak references (which are not enabled for our Objective-C++ sources).\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310261\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315563\n", "files": ["dom/webauthn/MacOSWebAuthnService.mm"], "git_node": "cce87f46df9c74fd720d2388b7cb6162f10f5fd0", "git_parents": ["aa24356bbecee5da0982046dae7a583b44403b84"], "node": "9dc30cc27f3194d11bc4895148e80a6b6a94908a", "parents": ["b05fc11db238b1282d83c3e989dfc33ae1a7aea5"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785708020, "git_changesets": ["cce87f46df9c74fd720d2388b7cb6162f10f5fd0"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "141": {"changesets": [{"author": "Harshit \u003chsohaney@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057946 - Do not open a new tab if restoring a session after a crash.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315374\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315632\n", "files": ["browser/components/sessionstore/SessionStore.sys.mjs", "browser/components/sessionstore/test/marionette/test_new_tab_on_restore.py"], "git_node": "9488ca0065aaa864efec2b25fddb46a263b0e595", "git_parents": ["cce87f46df9c74fd720d2388b7cb6162f10f5fd0"], "node": "d10aef7edf615d27eb7f0edce187ced2ce71177d", "parents": ["9dc30cc27f3194d11bc4895148e80a6b6a94908a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785708094, "git_changesets": ["9488ca0065aaa864efec2b25fddb46a263b0e595"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "142": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nika Layzell \u003cnika@thelayzells.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2054667 - ValidatePrincipal in PServiceWorkerRegistration,  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313528\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315748\n", "files": ["dom/serviceworkers/ServiceWorkerRegistration.cpp", "ipc/glue/BackgroundParentImpl.cpp"], "git_node": "47feb1850de5fbacd56b082f9c4f399d21a6c0df", "git_parents": ["9488ca0065aaa864efec2b25fddb46a263b0e595"], "node": "62c257f624d141360b0b051dd4dd3dc56722cbfa", "parents": ["d10aef7edf615d27eb7f0edce187ced2ce71177d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785708128, "git_changesets": ["47feb1850de5fbacd56b082f9c4f399d21a6c0df"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "143": {"changesets": [{"author": "Dianna Smith \u003cdsmith@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2054667 - ValidatePrincipal in PServiceWorkerRegistration,  a=diannaS for cuasing bustage a=backout\n\nThis reverts commit 47feb1850de5fbacd56b082f9c4f399d21a6c0df.\n", "files": ["dom/serviceworkers/ServiceWorkerRegistration.cpp", "ipc/glue/BackgroundParentImpl.cpp"], "git_node": "235167a74ffadbbe9e9347de29ecb54f8454a78c", "git_parents": ["47feb1850de5fbacd56b082f9c4f399d21a6c0df"], "node": "6dfee7c9b26e890f8013f4925dbe59cc058400f2", "parents": ["62c257f624d141360b0b051dd4dd3dc56722cbfa"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785708780, "git_changesets": ["235167a74ffadbbe9e9347de29ecb54f8454a78c"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, 