ce::loadSource an instance method and rename to tryLoadSource.  a=diannaS\n\nThere's no reason to use static method, and the later patch will rewrite this\npart.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312681\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315831\n", "files": ["js/src/debugger/Source.cpp", "js/src/jsapi.cpp", "js/src/vm/JSFunction.cpp", "js/src/vm/JSScript.cpp", "js/src/vm/JSScript.h"], "git_node": "4f1fac0c92e34be453487ad00c3b2e581a56d172", "git_parents": ["a89578fdbc09b6b4e7ed77a0f3abfbfd30c4dd72"], "node": "d8e5cb867dbe7e5ecc720d7f1b0f561076542ca5", "parents": ["2d9ff2b9d33546c2acf40564dc3e68664949c52a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tooru Fujisawa \u003carai_a@mac.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053670 - Part 3: Make ScriptSource::getSourceProperties an instance method.  a=diannaS\n\nThere's no reason to use static method, and the later patch will move this\nmethod into a new inner class.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312682\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315832\n", "files": ["js/src/vm/GeckoProfiler.cpp", "js/src/vm/JSScript.cpp", "js/src/vm/JSScript.h"], "git_node": "bccdd8622e30fb2999d4045caa527d59d47ce77a", "git_parents": ["4f1fac0c92e34be453487ad00c3b2e581a56d172"], "node": "6e7b78ada68d203c616ac0ce86126aaa1e5e3387", "parents": ["d8e5cb867dbe7e5ecc720d7f1b0f561076542ca5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tooru Fujisawa \u003carai_a@mac.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053670 - Part 4: Move ScriptSource::TriggerConvertToCompressedSourceFromTask to JSScript.cpp.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312683\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315833\n", "files": ["js/src/vm/JSScript.cpp", "js/src/vm/JSScript.h"], "git_node": "a500637efafc0dc18249ef603a234b019b4f54a8", "git_parents": ["bccdd8622e30fb2999d4045caa527d59d47ce77a"], "node": "0206826e