, but a JSWindowActorParent and its\npaired JSWindowActorChild always share the same BrowsingContext, so\nAutoScrollParent can just use its own `this.browsingContext` instead.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315468\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316390\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/apz/test/mochitest/browser_test_autoscrolling_in_oop_frame.js", "toolkit/actors/AutoScrollChild.sys.mjs", "toolkit/actors/AutoScrollParent.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "abfb1a2e1f8b7089362179b17d644a8119a3bbd7", "git_parents": ["3879511321bceed9360c81dd6241508bd912e54c"], "node": "f8060f8b8e302fdf5aa51d53dfc1ffea07e6934c", "parents": ["3d5e5d039884c483cc3b22b06f28664fa1aba511"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785954854, "git_changesets": ["abfb1a2e1f8b7089362179b17d644a8119a3bbd7"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "189": {"changesets": [{"author": "Dale Harvey \u003cdale@arandomurl.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2046307 - Focus trustpanel when opened via keyboard.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D307139\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D316486\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/browser-trustPanel.js", "browser/base/content/navigator-toolbox.js", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser/browser.toml", "browser/components/urlbar/tests/browser/browser_trust_panel_focus.js"], "git_node": "6118e69ef80973c87c8e11bc3dc9039347cd2dc1", "git_parents": ["abfb1a2e1f8b7089362179b17d644a8119a3bbd7"], "node": "a9020ce9f10d1a7b1c09711c2544884e5c8186d0", "parents": ["f8060f8b8e302fdf5aa51d53dfc1ffea07e6934c"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785954877, "git_changesets": ["6118e69ef80973c87c8e11bc3dc9039347cd2dc1"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "19": {"changesets": [{"author": "Chun-Min Chang \u003cchun.m.chang@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050480 - Unify NVImage NV12/NV21 to I420 conversion into a shared helper  a=diannaS\n\nDifferential Re