, "date": 1785266816, "git_changesets": ["bbc4e5c31ea3c4d77f22cd1ea22f263abd2e7773"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "67": {"changesets": [{"author": "Byron Campen \u003cdocfaraday@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2054787: Simplify this; alpn was hard-coded anyway.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313609\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314701\n", "files": ["dom/media/webrtc/jsapi/PeerConnectionImpl.cpp", "dom/media/webrtc/transport/ipc/WebrtcProxyConfig.ipdlh", "dom/media/webrtc/transport/ipc/WebrtcTCPSocket.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/HttpBaseChannel.cpp", "netwerk/test/unit/test_proxyconnect.js"], "git_node": "1bc46ce00a05d72817996890aac62c349814d168", "git_parents": ["bbc4e5c31ea3c4d77f22cd1ea22f263abd2e7773"], "node": "ecdeeebcfa960ad14c8108334aec04e1a23928e0", "parents": ["8987ad677ea74cdd550cd9d63f69564bd64cfc97"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785288991, "git_changesets": ["1bc46ce00a05d72817996890aac62c349814d168"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "68": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mathieu Leplatre \u003cmathieu@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2056571 - Cover case of promise rejection  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nTests are shipped in https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314015\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314013\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314867\n", "files": ["services/settings/RemoteSettingsClient.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "ce201dd4e4af63befff9e9611983d26cc9a1ab1f", "git_parents": ["1bc46ce00a05d72817996890aac62c349814d168"], "node": "5b9d51657399fb095abf5e2113f2c445dc12bf79", "parents": ["ecdeeebcfa960ad14c8108334aec04e1a23928e0"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785384479, "git_changesets": ["ce201dd4e4af63befff9e9611983d26cc9a1ab1f"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "69": {"changesets": [{"author": "Alastor Wu \u003calwu@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057995 - Bound the conversion source read to the mapped surface size in the image conversion helpers.  a=diannaS\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314473\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315012\n", "files": ["dom/media/ImageConversion.cpp"], "git_node": "75427e175edea62d70dd576f57e030fd48ca1621", "git_parents": ["ce201dd4e4af63befff9e9611983d26cc9a1ab1f"], "node": "5542c1e2a4f55f18d463a9d9e15fcc703627695f", "parents": ["5b9d51657399fb095abf5e2113f2c445dc12bf79"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785384575, "git_changesets": ["75427e175edea62d70dd576f57e030fd48ca1621"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "70": {"changesets": [{"author": "Florian Qu\u00e8ze \u003cflorian@queze.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2050963 - Pre-load verifier.dll before installing the exception handler, .  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nWhen MiniDumpWithHandleData is set, MiniDumpWriteDump suspends every other thread and then, while writing the handle-data stream, dbgcore (Win32LiveSystemProvider::StartHandleOperationsEnum) loads verifier.dll. On Win10+ that LoadLibrary blocks in LdrpDrainWorkQueue waiting on the loader worker threads MiniDumpWriteDump just suspended, so the dump never finishes and the crashing process never exits, holding the update lock long enough to intermittently fail test_backgroundupdate_exitcodes.js with OTHER_INSTANCE.\n\nPre-loading verifier.dll up front, next to the existing psapi.dll pre-load, makes it already resident when dbgcore loads it mid-dump so the load no longer blocks, while keeping the handle-data stream in our minidumps. This also backs out the skip-if added in D308902, re-enabling the test on Windows x86_64 opt.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D309183\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315113\n", "files": ["toolkit/crashreporter/nsExceptionHandler.cpp"], "git_node": "7425744db8150371c046b5ec538300ab9ced8d84", "git_parents": ["75427e175edea62d70dd576f57e030fd48ca1621"], "node": "4aa2bea4f42baafd5f5eeee7fab988a9693ddd59", "parents": ["5542c1e2a4f55f18d463a9d9e15fcc703627695f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785410612, "git_changesets": ["7425744db8150371c046b5ec538300ab9ced8d84"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "71": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jed Davis \u003cjld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049339 - Modernize handling of received fds in IPC.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310965\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315121\n", "files": ["ipc/chromium/src/chrome/common/ipc_channel_posix.cc", "ipc/chromium/src/chrome/common/ipc_channel_posix.h"], "git_node": "57d8b9eb9f0b1d27429be01fe467575b38478236", "git_parents": ["7425744db8150371c046b5ec538300ab9ced8d84"], "node": "1ce56ff13b8fcb6cb9738e19ba596c1630d7e9da", "parents": ["4aa2bea4f42baafd5f5eeee7fab988a9693ddd59"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785410631, "git_changesets": ["57d8b9eb9f0b1d27429be01fe467575b38478236"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "72": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jed Davis \u003cjld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2049393 - Try to clean up some integer wrangling in IPC.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nI don't think any of this is exploitable, but:\n* Add a bunch of overflow checks.\n* Remove a couple of checks that are now superfluous.\n* Widen some arguments to `size_t` to avoid silent truncation.\n\nI ran some perf tests on CI and didn't see any obvious regressions.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312391\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D315119\n", "files": ["ipc/chromium/src/base/pickle.cc", "ipc/chromium/src/base/pickle.h", "ipc/chromium/src/chrome/common/ipc_message_utils.h", "mfbt/BufferList.h"], "git_node": "7c0477a92da9e478312f86345109b974feedd825", "git_parents": ["57d8b9eb9f0b1d27429be01fe467575b38478236"], "node": "58b0ddb0d2a05d0465dca2b65e0558a2966114d6", "parents": ["1ce56ff13b8fcb6cb9738e19ba596c1630d7e9da"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785410655, "git_changesets": ["7c0477a92da9e478312f86345109b974feedd825"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "73": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053261 - Allow overlapping vertex groups.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nThe code was previously assuming that the vertex stride is always larger than the vertex size which is not necessarily true per spec. This patches fixes that by computing the number of times the stride fits in the buffer after having removed the size of the last element (following a similar logic to what the (much better) webgpu spec describes to validate the equivalent API.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310994\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313675\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/WebGLContext.cpp", "dom/canvas/WebGLContext.h"], "git_node": "dd1df74c885d221357175e3df4a9a53990b45244", "git_parents": ["7c0477a92da9e478312f86345109b974feedd825"], "node": "fa1fb49a8c6b2d5dc7c3fb02d601155cc20a9069", "parents": ["58b0ddb0d2a05d0465dca2b65e0558a2966114d6"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785410813, "git_changesets": ["dd1df74c885d221357175e3df4a9a53990b45244"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "74": {"changesets": [{"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057894 - Don't apply vertical-align to ::placeholder.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nIn the regressing bug we did the same for line-height for similar\nreasons. In this case the site is setting vertical-align on\n::placeholder but expecting it not to have an effect.\n\nIt doesn't have an effect per spec:\n\n\u003e All properties that apply to the ::first-line pseudo-element also\n\u003e apply to the ::placeholder pseudo-element, except those defined in\n\u003e [CSS-INLINE-3].\n\nImplement that to the letter (which in practice only impacts\nvertical-align).\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314283\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314606\n", "files": ["layout/style/test/property_database.js", "servo/components/style/properties/data.py", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-pseudo/placeholder-vertical-align-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-pseudo/placeholder-vertical-align.html"], "git_node": "b709ef726894bbc0c2788ddcf00730d4f11a4f49", "git_parents": ["dd1df74c885d221357175e3df4a9a53990b45244"], "node": "c5c455afccdc7b035baf44e89ff905857a965545", "parents": ["fa1fb49a8c6b2d5dc7c3fb02d601155cc20a9069"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785410928, "git_changesets": ["b709ef726894bbc0c2788ddcf00730d4f11a4f49"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "75": {"changesets": [{"author": "Yoshi Cheng-Hao Huang \u003callstars.chh@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2054717 - Sync ModuleScript's preload flag.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313007\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313356\n", "files": ["js/loader/ModuleLoadRequest.cpp", "js/loader/ModuleLoaderBase.cpp"], "git_node": "5d254f008b97f064b337b76ea9f0ebfc4b060217", "git_parents": ["b709ef726894bbc0c2788ddcf00730d4f11a4f49"], "node": "6c2787c2b9631a1fd55d005a8af145f8018110e6", "parents": ["c5c455afccdc7b035baf44e89ff905857a965545"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Yoshi Cheng-Hao Huang \u003callstars.chh@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2054717 - Test.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313008\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313357\n", "files": ["dom/base/test/jsmodules/importmaps/multiple/mochitest.toml", "dom/base/test/jsmodules/importmaps/multiple/moz.build", "dom/base/test/jsmodules/importmaps/multiple/test_bug_2054717.html"], "git_node": "ccd46143b486c26adcaf55250c5b32d360a8a592", "git_parents": ["5d254f008b97f064b337b76ea9f0ebfc4b060217"], "node": "4c7b815bc2e4744fb902e887c9c622a868bfbbf1", "parents": ["6c2787c2b9631a1fd55d005a8af145f8018110e6"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785410971, "git_changesets": ["5d254f008b97f064b337b76ea9f0ebfc4b060217", "ccd46143b486c26adcaf55250c5b32d360a8a592"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "76": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2053260 - Set the same limit to WebGL buffer sizes as WebGPU.  a=diannaS\n\nUncoditionally, just like in WebGPU.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D310999\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313672\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/WebGLBuffer.cpp"], "git_node": "020ffd8e92e8b149c3492a4e8b107ffebecb8fc5", "git_parents": ["ccd46143b486c26adcaf55250c5b32d360a8a592"], "node": "d601f3e3aba062415d5e903b2c96a34bbf521997", "parents": ["4c7b815bc2e4744fb902e887c9c622a868bfbbf1"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785411036, "git_changesets": ["020ffd8e92e8b149c3492a4e8b107ffebecb8fc5"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "77": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andrea Marchesini \u003camarchesini@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2048353 - Improve worker shutdown support in CookieStoreNotificationWatcher   a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D311765\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314995\n", "files": ["dom/cookiestore/CookieStoreNotificationWatcherWrapper.cpp"], "git_node": "d2b3468a5adb4d5c4476387078e7b01fdc684791", "git_parents": ["020ffd8e92e8b149c3492a4e8b107ffebecb8fc5"], "node": "a2b2340d1e7b417985a721c59070178cc8b20598", "parents": ["d601f3e3aba062415d5e903b2c96a34bbf521997"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785412042, "git_changesets": ["d2b3468a5adb4d5c4476387078e7b01fdc684791"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "78": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan-Niklas Jaeschke \u003cjjaschke@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2057778 - Verify target document after ancestor revealing algorithm in GoToAnchor.  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314590\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314627\n", "files": ["layout/base/PresShell.cpp"], "git_node": "52a394eb3978f65c493ee22e701cab8ce5bd5fc7", "git_parents": ["d2b3468a5adb4d5c4476387078e7b01fdc684791"], "node": "cd2b0c8dda9b26e6888f8dde9f1ce7716f900419", "parents": ["a2b2340d1e7b417985a721c59070178cc8b20598"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785412061, "git_changesets": ["52a394eb3978f65c493ee22e701cab8ce5bd5fc7"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "79": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jon Coppeard \u003cjcoppeard@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2052490 - Don't release buffer allocator lock before checking GC state  a=diannaS DONTBUILD\n\nThere's an intermittent assertion failure because we release the lock between\nmerging swept data and checking the expected GC state which allows the\nbackground sweeping task to add more chunks to the swept chunks lists. When we\nmerge this data the expected state will be restored restored.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D312447\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D314847\n", "files": ["js/src/gc/BufferAllocator.cpp"], "git_node": "d8a1d3b6bd4f4de676a3310f959e9fa42727bbf8", "git_parents": ["52a394eb3978f65c493ee22e701cab8ce5bd5fc7"], "node": "fb65f765cc8264e712f885e0e4242e6ce567b3c9", "parents": ["cd2b0c8dda9b26e6888f8dde9f1ce7716f900419"], "tags": []}], "date": 1785412078, "git_changesets": ["d8a1d3b6bd4f4de676a3310f959e9fa42727bbf8"], "user": "dsmith@mozilla.com"}, "8": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging fcc71af71c089d5fd852081575decf36b7e05b8d with FIREFOX_153_0b1_RELEASE a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "3bd8bd